WEBVTT

00:02:58.079 --> 00:03:02.579
I was seeing Muslims wearing big billowing
white skirts that would outdo

00:03:02.579 --> 00:03:04.246
Kim Kardashian on her wedding day,

00:03:05.288 --> 00:03:08.871
limping their wrists and twirling around
the sound of an imam singing.

00:03:09.413 --> 00:03:11.954
I directly identified with
the Muslims I was seeing

00:03:11.954 --> 00:03:13.788
on screen who are each searching

00:03:13.788 --> 00:03:16.621
for higher meaning through
costume ritual music.

00:03:17.496 --> 00:03:20.663
I realized that I'm doing the exact
same thing every time I'm in drag.

00:03:20.829 --> 00:03:23.204
I'm searching for a transcendental
connection,

00:03:23.454 --> 00:03:26.413
which is sort of brought to me through
the collective queer energy of

00:03:26.788 --> 00:03:31.413
the audience. Now, before a drag show,
I actually like to do Muslim prayers,